# cavekit-find-on-page.md R1 (T-678): the long-press menu's Find on Page opens the find bar with its field focused and
# the keyboard up, in each shell.
id: find-hold-menu
section: Find on page
item: A hold on a page's text, then the menu's Find on Page: the find bar opens with the keyboard up, and "zebra" typed is found 1 of 6
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-find.html
kit: cavekit-find-on-page.md R1
calibrate top
sample before-hold 0,100,500,500
hold-on p1
wait line 'notify: page-hold' 8
wait differs 0,100,500,500 before-hold 5
wait still 0,100,500,500 3
chrome hold-find
expect keyboard up 8
type-keys zebra
wait line 'find .5 bytes. -> 1' 10
wait line 'find-result: {"index":1,"total":6' 10
mark
chrome find-done
wait line 'find: cleared' 8
expect keyboard down 8
